{"3649420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stickman Physics Battle Arena", "steam_appid": 3649420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4462430], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649420/extras/7a84a11841baa188bfa9fafc00caec4d.avif?t=1774916193\" width=908 height=689 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Stickman Physics Battle Arena, you must level up and become the greatest warrior to unlock the ultimate weapons in a bloody physics playground! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649420/extras/b70a4f4f11d9abf98c6f02e83192283f.avif?t=1774916193\" width=908 height=689 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡️ Welcome to the Battle Arena! 🛡️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Dismember your enemies, litter the arena with bodies and paint the town red to earn 3 stars in every level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Let loose in a physics playground where everything is interactive; throw shoot and explode weapons, items, opponents, structures and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Dual wield over 90 fun and unique weapons used by knights, ninjas, soldiers, scientists and sorcerers, as well as power tools and even toys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Play 2 player co-op and VS; play with 1 or 2 gamepads, dual control with touch or enable player AI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Custom made interactive music takes you on a journey as you progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Track your stats throughout your career</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649420/extras/583f123a74bfcd63223169383b5126ba.avif?t=1774916193\" width=908 height=689 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ 7 different game modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡️ Campaign: 26 levels with progressively tougher enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡️ Battle Arena: 7 survival levels where you fight until you drop for a big reward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡️ Challengers: 13 Bosses to challenge your skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡️ Twin Serpent: A continuous side scrolling adventure with an overhead view paying homage to arcade games of old</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡️ Invasion: Slime mold has invaded the world! Defeat the horrible blobs and the zombies they created in this continuous side scrolling mode featuring random weapon drops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡️ Defense: Defend or destroy your angry birds style physics tower in an ongoing battle against waves of enemies in 6 different stages across 22 levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡️ VS: Enter the ring against a friend with 2 player vs mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649420/extras/209eb706ce02c960a39f5ae425fc04c1.avif?t=1774916193\" width=908 height=689 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649420/extras/de1a40d628f3da3152ce3b8d06b799aa.avif?t=1774916193\" width=908 height=689 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649420/extras/6bd877655004b855ac519d2ca34d30fa.avif?t=1774916193\" width=908 height=689 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649420/extras/ab8bee747bb8b8235dc4a794ce1f2e5e.avif?t=1774916193\" width=908 height=689 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a